  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You create an acidic bubble at a point within range, where it explodes in a 5-foot-radius Sphere. Each creature in that Sphere must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or take 1d6 Acid damage.</p><p><strong>Cantrip Upgrade.</strong> The damage increases by 1d6 when you reach levels 5 (2d6), 11 (3d6), and 17 (4d6).</p>",
